cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SWC-Studio in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "SWC-Studio"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application, command-line interface and Python package for
  quality control of neuron morphology reconstructions in SWC format. It
  validates files against structural, geometric and annotation checks,
  repairs the issues it finds, labels soma, axon, basal and apical
  dendrite from geometry with the SWC auto-labeler, and records every edit
  in a per-file provenance history.
